Comment: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:09.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Opening Talk ===
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:09.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Good evening! I'm Tomomi Jiena Sumi,\Nthe voice of An Shiraishi from Vivid BAD SQUAD!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:14.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Good evening. I'm Kent Ito,\Nthe voice of Toya Aoyagi from Vivid BAD SQUAD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:18.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji is a radio program brought to you by the cast of Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:23.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,feat. Hatsune Miku. We'll be your hosts for this episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:27.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yes! Well, here we are. We're finally doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We are, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:34.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder how long it's been?\NI always lose track of when we last worked together in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.01,0:00:36.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder when it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:40.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It feels like we do it often,\Nbut it also feels like it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:41.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:41.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't remember a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:43.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Not a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:47.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Actually, completely unrelated to work,\Nwe ran into each other on the train once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:50.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I was so surprised when we passed each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:49.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:53.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was shocked. Since it was so sudden and random,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:55.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I just blurted out a greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:58.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Then I immediately regretted it,\Nlike, "Oh, sorry for bothering you."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:00.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, no, no. We were right near the doors,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:05.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,so it was just a quick "Oh!" and then you were gone like the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:04.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:11.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And we were both probably riding\Nwith colleagues or people from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:09.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm, mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:12.85,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, so I felt even worse about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.85,0:01:14.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sorry too. But I was actually happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:18.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, because I got asked about it later on LINE.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,They were like, "Who was that?" and I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:23.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"That was Jiena-san." "Oh, okay." Neither of our companions realized
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,who the other was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:29.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,On my end, I was like,\N"Uh, well... that's someone I work with in the same unit."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.89,0:01:33.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. It's confusing for the people we're with,\Nso I felt bad about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:36.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So that happened, but...
Comment: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:37.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:37.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that definitely happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:37.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yep, it's been since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:38.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:39.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:39.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:40.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,What are we even talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, winter is in full swing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.05,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is. It's gotten so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.05,0:01:44.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Have you turned on your heater yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:44.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got it on all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:47.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, mine is definitely on too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:47.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:53.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I mean, last night I accidentally fell asleep without it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:54.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:55.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And it was freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:55.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I bet it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:57.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I woke up in the middle of the night like, "So cold!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:02:01.69,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've gotta get the blankets out and make sure you don't catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:08.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. At my place,\Nmy bed is just covered in pillows and blankets...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:08.34,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.59,0:02:10.47,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's kind of a mess, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:12.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:20.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,They aren't neatly laid out or anything. I have several pillows,\Nand I just pick which one to use based on my mood that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:25.62,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,What?! That sounds like a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:23.19,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.19,0:02:27.49,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'll decide, "Today I want\Nthis pillow for my head,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:31.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and then I'll just grab\Nanother one nearby to hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:32.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's how I sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.39,0:02:34.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:39.19,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And around my stomach, I've got\Nwinter duvets and towel blankets,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:42.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,just scattered all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:42.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Comment: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:42.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:42.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:47.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So, I choose what to use based on how I feel that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:47.69,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:52.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but yesterday, I was sleeping normally when I got cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:55.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,so I had to redo my setup with another blanket.\NThat's how my day went.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:55.39,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:02:59.49,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's tricky, because it's still warm during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:02:59.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:04.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, and it's still a bit too hot to go out in a coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:04.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:05.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you walk a bit during the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.89,0:03:09.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,you end up dripping with sweat\Non the train and wondering what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:10.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:11.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Days like that have been continuing lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:12.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,They really have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:13.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Jiena-san, do you get hot easily?\NOr are you sensitive to the cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.69,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm very sensitive to the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:16.45,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:18.93,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So I'm already wearing my Heattech and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:19.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's early!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.59,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.53,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're opposites.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:21.69,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:22.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're total opposites.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:25.74,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We might not be able to see eye to eye on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:28.49,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,See, I actually really love the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:30.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really? You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I love it. I'm good with it and I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:32.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:34.07,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Comment: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:36.79,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:36.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't even own any thermal underwear,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.78,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:38.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and I probably never use those disposable heat packs either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.99,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. That must be nice, in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:45.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It is. It's nice, but on the flip side, I absolutely hate summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:47.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, because you end up dripping with sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:53.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. I mean, in winter you can just layer up,\Nbut in summer, even if you're down to nothing, it's still hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:55.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It's hot. It might even feel hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:58.59,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right. And you're constantly sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:59.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:03.09,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,When I sweat,\NI start feeling really bad for the people around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:03.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like when you're walking through the city...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:05.04,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.79,0:04:07.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's unpleasant, isn't it? Other people's sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:08.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:08.49,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Especially if you're about to brush against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:09.79,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you definitely worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:14.84,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. I feel like I'm constantly thinking "Oh, sorry" much more often in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:14.69,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:19.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, speaking of the season,\Nit seems it's already final exam time for students.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.41,0:04:17.42,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:20.29,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:21.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So fast. Good luck, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:25.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Thinking back,\Nhaving a test every month and a half is just awful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.69,0:04:27.99,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ugh, it really is. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:29.48,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I don't know how we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.39,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.39,0:04:32.09,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You never really get a break, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.09,0:04:34.59,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true. Finals are really important, too.
Comment: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:38.44,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:38.44,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're working hard.\NIt's the end of the second term, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:37.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:40.73,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, it's already that time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:41.49,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.49,0:04:44.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Depending on the person, like for those taking entrance exams,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:47.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,students in their third year of middle or high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:47.99,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:51.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,They probably feel like they're almost free\Nfrom school exams, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:54.29,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.99,0:04:55.19,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, depending on the person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:05:02.19,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,University students too. For those\Nin their second or fourth year who've already landed a job,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:02.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:06.04,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,you should definitely make sure to have fun\Nduring the third term.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:08.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:13.22,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, that time in university is right\Nbefore you enter the workforce,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:09.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.09,0:05:13.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:16.09,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,so it might be the most free few months of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:16.09,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:17.25,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.39,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,You should have fun while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:19.64,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:21.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:22.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:24.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I hope you all have a winter like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:25.99,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:27.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,And with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:31.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I ended up talking from the perspective of an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:34.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So, with this old man and old lady here...
Comment: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:34.33,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:34.33,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:36.25,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wait, "old lady"? Hey, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, no, wait. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:40.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,If you're an old lady, then I'm an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:46.69,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, well then, let's start this SekaRaji\Nwith your favorite big brother and big sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.09,0:05:47.79,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'm honored, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.69,0:05:47.79,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:48.74,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:59.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,This program is brought to you by Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:01.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,feat. Hatsune Miku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:08.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm Tomomi Jiena Sumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And I'm Kent Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:10.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Now then...
Comment: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:13.19,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Exchange Notebook ===
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:13.19,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,We have another question in the exchange notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:13.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:19.60,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from our previous guests,\NYui Ogura and Rina Honnizumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:19.44,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:22.69,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"What is something you want to do before the end of the year?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:24.69,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Ogura-san wants to redecorate her room."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:25.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:26.69,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"And Honnizumi-san wants to go to a hot spring."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:27.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah! That sounds lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:29.30,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Do you have anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:33.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, something I want to do before the end of the year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:35.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I want to go to a hot spring too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:37.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I definitely want to go to a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:40.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I mean, anytime is fine,\Nbut since it's before the end of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:43.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'd like to feel like I actually got it done.\NI always want to go, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:44.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:46.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I want to be able to look back and say I actually went.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:47.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:50.43,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,As for something I haven't done yet... what would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:52.27,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:53.25,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:54.77,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,it's wandering around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.77,0:06:55.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wandering around town?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:57.27,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Just strolling through the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ahhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:00.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:00.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:02.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I went to Shinjuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:02.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Comment: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:05.39,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:05.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's been a while. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:11.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,usually you don't use a station unless you have a specific reason to go there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:11.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:17.33,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I pass through Shinjuku Station a lot,\Nbut I don't actually go out into the city that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:17.33,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I just don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:19.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:23.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,At least for me. I might go for shopping,\Nbut even then, I'm heading straight for my destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:23.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:28.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,If I'm going to Isetan after getting off at Shinjuku,\NI usually just walk through the underground passages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:28.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:33.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's about a one-station walk\Nfrom Shinjuku Station to the Shinjuku Isetan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:33.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.89,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:39.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'm not getting off\Nwith the goal of enjoying the sights along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:39.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:42.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But I tried doing exactly that in Shinjuku the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.55,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:43.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:45.32,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I felt like Urashima Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:48.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "Whoa, this shop changed!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:49.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:50.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Or, "There are more arcades now."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:51.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, I see, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:55.69,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So,\NI really felt the passage of time and how the world has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:08:02.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It was like, "Whoa, where are all the Japanese people?" It was\Nthat kind of situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:02.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But I thought that was interesting in its own way.
Comment: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:09.20,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:09.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, game centers... You know,\Ngame centers have a lot of ProSeka merch these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:09.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:12.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But the Taito Station at the Shinjuku East Exit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:12.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:19.67,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I used to work there part-time. I've mentioned it\Nin a few other places, so I think it's fine to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:19.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:21.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I saw they'd added another\NTaito Station Shinjuku East Exit store
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:22.52,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,when I went there recently!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:22.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa! Really? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:23.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, when I went the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:28.17,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,There was another store right across from the one\Nwhere I used to work. I was like, "Seriously?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:31.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So I felt a little happy about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:35.52,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and while I was watching the crane games getting all lively,\NI decided to play some myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:36.02,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you did? Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:40.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was kind of studying how crane games work these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and I actually managed to win a few prizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:42.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:44.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I enjoyed myself just like Toya would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:50.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Then I went home.\NIt made me realize I should really do that once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:50.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:53.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So next time, I want to try playing at a different station.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:53.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:55.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:09:00.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.\NIt's great to be able to spend your own time relaxing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:00.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And Jiena-san, you said the hot springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:01.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd love to go to a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:04.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Where would you want to go? Any specific area?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:07.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I'd prefer somewhere close to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'd like somewhere I can just pop over to for a day trip.
Comment: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:12.13,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:12.13,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, a day trip, a day trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:13.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,When you think of day trips,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:16.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,maybe Shizuoka or Yamanashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:18.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, those sound about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:20.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Karuizawa is another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever been to Karuizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.81,0:09:23.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:28.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Actually, if you take the Shinkansen, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:28.59,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:31.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,it might be the fastest place to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:33.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.10,0:09:36.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, it takes exactly one hour from Tokyo to Karuizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:34.38,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:38.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Once the train starts moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:38.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:39.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So it's closer than you'd think, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.90,0:09:41.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, one hour is totally doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:43.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I could definitely do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:44.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I highly recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:48.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Man, I really want to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.45,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:50.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A hot spring trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:51.43,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:53.07,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:52.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.95,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,All right, and later in the ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:55.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Comment: 0,0:09:54.95,0:10:00.00,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:10:00.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,we'll also be leaving a comment\Nin the exchange notebook for the next pair of hosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see...
Comment: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.50,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.50,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right, let's read some listener mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:06.50,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,First, we have some general mail,\Nthough we've received themed messages as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:03.92,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:06.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:08.60,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Radio name: Neyachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:08.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Neyachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:11.74,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Hello, Jiena-san and Kent Ito-san! Kon-vivid!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.55,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-vivid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:12.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Kon-vivid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.71,0:10:19.10,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The other day, while cleaning my room for the end of the year, I found some ProSeka merch I'd tucked away."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:19.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:24.70,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I don't clean much, but besides tidying up,\NI made fun discoveries and want to do it again."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:24.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:29.90,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Have either of you ever found anything nostalgic or unexpected while cleaning?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:34.30,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It's getting colder, so please take care of yourselves."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Finding something
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:38.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,that makes you feel nostalgic
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:39.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,while cleaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That happens, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.05,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:43.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.49,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,it definitely happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.49,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It does?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:45.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:46.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.43,0:10:47.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:49.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,merch that was tucked away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:49.95,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:52.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We tend to receive a lot of merch\Nfrom the projects we're in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:51.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Comment: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:55.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And when I look at them occasionally...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:55.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.10,0:10:58.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It really brings back memories of the story scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:00.02,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:01.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, if there's merchandise with stills or...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.95,0:11:02.17,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:07.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,...full-page illustrations,\Nit makes me think, "Oh, I remember this event."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:09.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. And even the characters' visuals...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,...have changed a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:13.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:13.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Since the beginning. Well, their school years changed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:16.66,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:19.27,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It makes me think, "Ah, they looked like this at the start."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:20.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:20.45,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It really brings it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:24.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,As for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:28.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't really like having too many things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:30.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm the type where this goes here, and that goes there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:30.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.30,0:11:34.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So once I've got everything arranged in its place,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:36.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't touch them at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.19,0:11:37.43,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You don't touch them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:38.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Even when I'm cleaning, how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:39.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Just that spot...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:39.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The bare minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.54,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, just the bare essentials.
Comment: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:42.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:42.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.50,0:11:43.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You don't have anything to pull out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:45.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:47.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder when I'll ever get to that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:49.35,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's so impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:52.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,How admirable! You really know how to declutter properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:56.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just can't relax\Nwhen there's too much stuff around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.85,0:11:58.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:03.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well then, out of everything left in your room,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:01.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:03.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:06.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,what's the oldest item, or the one most packed with memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:09.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't keep things just because they have memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.65,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wow! That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:13.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, no, haha, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:17.38,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I might not even have anything like that. It might not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:18.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It might not even exist...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:20.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,What's the thing I've had the longest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:20.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Maybe there really isn't anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I only have things like my clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A clock? Well, that's still good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:27.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's full of memories in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:30.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true. A clock I've used for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:31.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A clock for your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:31.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:32.45,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:35.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like the memory of when you bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:35.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:38.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, "I bought this at that place."
Comment: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:38.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:38.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:41.28,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Even the little things definitely count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:42.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:43.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:47.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wish I could live like that,\Nbut it's just not in the cards for me in this lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:49.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I could never do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:52.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,But I feel like a place with lots of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:56.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It sounds like a place filled with a lot of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:13:01.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder... honestly, there's plenty of stuff there\Nthat I don't even need anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:01.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.21,0:13:02.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:05.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Why am I even keeping this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:05.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:12.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'll think,\N"Oh, I got this at an arcade two or three years ago..."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:12.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:16.85,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But then I realize it's actually from way longer ago than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:18.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'm just like, "Wait, really?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:19.65,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That happens, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:23.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll think I won something just last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:26.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but when I look it up, it turns out it was three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:28.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,The fact that you're winning things so regularly is hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:33.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just end up doing it.\NThis is actually a Toya sync point for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:34.43,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:36.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but when I see a new game or a new prize,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:40.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I get curious and just have to go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's great, it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:46.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's terrifying, really. Plus,\Nnow that I'm an adult, I'll keep going until I win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:48.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, true. It's different from when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:52.23,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. Giving up halfway through is no longer an option.
Comment: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:52.23,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:52.23,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:53.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:55.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,As a result, it becomes even harder to throw things away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:57.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, but it's important to cherish them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:59.84,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly. That's what I was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:00.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:00.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:04.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Next, we have a message from Radio name: Solly.\N"Jiena-san, Ito-san, good evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:09.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The other day, I finally got to try wanko soba, which I'd been wanting to do for a long time."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:09.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:13.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I've had this small dream of trying wanko soba since I was a kid,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:14.34,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:17.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"and I was finally able to make it happen in Morioka."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:17.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:21.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Once I started, the bowls of soba were served at a much faster pace than I imagined,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:21.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:24.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"and halfway through, it became a battle between deliciousness and pain."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:25.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:28.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"In the end, I managed to eat 160 bowls."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:31.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Whoa! Wait, isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:31.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:31.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:34.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I was just so happy to have fulfilled one of my childhood dreams."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:39.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Do you two have anything you've longed for since childhood or any dreams you've realized as adults?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:40.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they sent in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:41.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:44.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,160 is actually pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:48.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm pretty sure for wanko soba,\Nonce you pass 100, you're doing really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:49.98,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But 160!
Comment: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:50.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:50.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wow, they must have really saved up their...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:57.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So they finally unleashed their inner desire for wanko soba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:57.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:15:00.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's even faster than you'd think.\NThey're literally standing right there waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're already on standby right next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:05.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow. Have you ever done it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:05.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:06.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,How many bowls did you get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:10.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I don't think I quite made it to 100, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:10.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:14.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, there are plenty of places right\Nin front of Morioka Station where you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:16.02,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.53,0:15:18.19,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:20.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing. You start wondering\Nat what kind of crazy pace the shop is boiling the noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:22.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.70,0:15:24.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wait, have you never tried wanko soba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:27.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Never. It sounds fun, though. I'd love to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.50,0:15:30.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, it really is a whole cultural experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.75,0:15:31.25,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It sounds like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:34.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Morioka is the place for it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:35.87,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I want you to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:36.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:38.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So, as for things you want to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:39.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Or things I've always dreamed of?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:41.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Things you've dreamed of.
Comment: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:46.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:46.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, let's see. I actually still have something\NI've always dreamed of doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:46.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:48.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I want to get a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:52.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I've wanted a dog since I was a kid.\NI want to sleep with one in my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:54.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, so you've never owned one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:56.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,No, I've never had one of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:16:00.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see. So you've just helped look\Nafter a friend's dog or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, or my sister's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:03.75,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:05.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Or at my mom's family home, that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:05.88,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:08.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So it has to be a dog, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:11.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I want to get a dog and have it sleep with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.85,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Not a cat or a bird? It specifically has to be a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:19.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I've never owned one myself either, but my relatives have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:19.83,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:26.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Apparently,\Nmy family had one for a very short time right after I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:26.85,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:32.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's about it. It shows up in old family photos\Nwhen I look back at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:32.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:34.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We had a beagle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:34.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,A beagle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:40.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But since it was there when I was born,\Nthere were dog-related things around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:40.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:48.25,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like a gate or a step on the floor.\NThere were traces that we used to have a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:49.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A dog, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:53.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Having a dog seems like it would really help fix your daily routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true, like waking up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:56.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Waking up properly\Nin the morning and coming home on time at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:59.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, and eating your meals at the right times too.
Comment: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:02.10,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:02.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A pet... Yeah, when you put it that way, a pet sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:05.64,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I hope to make that dream come true someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:06.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I really admire that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:06.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:11.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,If I were to get a pet, a cat would probably be more my speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:11.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. So, my birthday was in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:19.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and even though I never said a word\Nabout liking cats or wanting to own one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:25.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,For some reason, I got a cat encyclopedia
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:29.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and a book called "The Cat White Paper"\Nas birthday presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:29.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.60,0:17:34.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got these books that cover everything\Nfrom how to raise them to all the different breeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:37.70,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was wondering why I got them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:39.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was wondering why, but then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:40.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Why, indeed. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.53,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Then I realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:41.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:43.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I encountered a stray cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:43.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:47.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, I ran into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:48.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:50.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,This is a bit hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:50.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:52.27,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, at my parents' house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.27,0:17:53.93,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.93,0:17:59.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I mean, my parents' place is really close by,\Nbut it's just my mother living there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:57.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:17:59.20,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:03.15,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, we were talking about how a stray cat had shown up\Nat the house, right after I'd gotten those cat books.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:04.42,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:07.50,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Comment: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:07.50,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:07.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:10.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So a stray cat left a little present in the yard and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:12.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:18.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Actually, it was the other way around.\NI found poop in the yard and realized a cat had been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:17.87,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:19.93,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:23.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And, well, it was one of those cats\Nwith a little notch in its ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:24.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:26.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So that means it's been properly... you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:33.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,neutered and is being looked after by the local government.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.09,0:18:29.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.10,0:18:32.44,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.95,0:18:34.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:34.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Since that cat showed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:35.70,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:40.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I felt like maybe it was a sign, or something like destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.15,0:18:40.65,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:44.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I haven't actually started taking care of it yet,\Nand I haven't even seen it since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.44,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:51.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I decided that if it happens again,\NI'm going to take it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:51.60,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.26,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:55.00,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I talked it over with my mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:58.90,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And I went ahead and bought some Churu treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:18:58.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So you're ready anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:00.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Just in case it comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:03.47,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,So you can lure it in.
Comment: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:04.30,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:04.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. So even though...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:04.30,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Even though you're all prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.30,0:19:09.85,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I definitely have that aspiration.\NI'd love to welcome them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:08.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:11.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I agree. It would be great if they showed up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:15.57,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Who knows? We'll have to see what fate has in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.22,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:16.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:16.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And that's all for this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:22.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're always looking for questions or topics you'd like to ask the ProSeka cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:23.05,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:30.20,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song ===
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:30.20,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Now, it is time for a song.\NJiena-san, do you remember the song we are playing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:28.93,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:31.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:31.80,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:40.80,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It is just so emotional. It really hits home, like,\N"Toya has a lot of songs like this, doesn't he?" I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:34.66,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:38.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:47.30,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That is true. Lately, I have had this image\Nthat Toya gets a lot of "light" songs within VBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:41.82,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:48.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:49.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:56.05,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I feel like heavier songs or darker themes\Nusually go to the other members
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.01,0:19:53.55,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,during their focus events.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.05,0:19:58.55,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:20:07.10,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So I realized that Toya hasn't really done many songs\Nwith heavy themes lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.11,0:20:03.27,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:05.42,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:07.10,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:10.40,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So in that sense, it is a very memorable song for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:10.90,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:16.15,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,All right, please have a listen: "Touka suru Ondo."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.11,0:22:18.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji!
Comment: 0,0:22:22.51,0:22:26.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.51,0:22:26.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We asked for listener mail based on this theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.91,0:22:30.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,"This is how we made up!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.91,0:22:34.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.61,0:22:34.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.31,0:22:39.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, we asked everyone to send\Nin stories of how they reconciled with family or friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.96,0:22:39.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.01,0:22:42.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Well then, let's introduce some of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:42.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yes, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.41,0:22:45.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Radio name: Rera.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.95,0:22:46.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.51,0:22:46.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Kon-vivid!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.51,0:22:47.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Kon-vivid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.31,0:22:49.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This is the first time I'm sending in listener mail."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:49.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:50.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:55.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The other day, I had a fight with a friend I've known since kindergarten."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:55.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.01,0:23:00.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I wanted to make up, so I decided to try making them laugh with an inside joke."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:00.96,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:06.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"At first, they didn't laugh at all and things felt really awkward, but..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:06.56,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.11,0:23:10.15,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I kept pushing and pushing, and they finally laughed!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.15,0:23:13.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"We both got the giggles and were able to talk like we usually do."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.91,0:23:19.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It took courage to speak up, but their presence in my life was so big that we made up!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:21.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Ah, that's so good. Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:22.12,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.31,0:23:23.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You didn't let your heart break.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:24.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,You just kept pushing.
Comment: 0,0:23:24.41,0:23:26.21,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.41,0:23:26.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:28.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It sounds just like VBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.51,0:23:28.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.31,0:23:32.35,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It took a few steps, but it was like, "Please, just laugh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.46,0:23:32.35,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.35,0:23:33.98,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"Reach them!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:36.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"Laugh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.61,0:23:36.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.51,0:23:38.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,A real power gag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.84,0:23:39.28,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.61,0:23:42.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's nice, and I like how they realized their true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.91,0:23:44.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,in the second half of the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.51,0:23:45.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.91,0:23:49.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,More than the courage it took,\Nthe presence of that friend was just bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.61,0:23:53.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right. If you just think, "Oh, it's no use," and give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.29,0:23:55.13,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.81,0:23:55.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,then it really is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.13,0:23:57.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It would've ended there.\NI'm a little curious about the gag itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.78,0:23:59.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Me too, I'm curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.71,0:24:00.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,What did they say...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.21,0:24:01.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.41,0:24:05.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We might hear it and think, "Well, no wonder they didn't laugh."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.61,0:24:06.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,An inside joke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:13.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,An inside joke. But man,\Nmaking up after being friends since kindergarten...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.71,0:24:17.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I wonder how many years they've been together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.54,0:24:17.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.21,0:24:21.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,If it's since kindergarten, you probably barely even remember
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.21,0:24:23.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,meeting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.86,0:24:23.36,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.51,0:24:27.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I remember things like,\N"Oh, this happened," or "We had a recital."
Comment: 0,0:24:27.31,0:24:32.11,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.31,0:24:32.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's impressive that they can still have fights like\Nthat after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.01,0:24:32.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.11,0:24:34.03,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So you guys still have disagreements sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.03,0:24:36.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:36.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.51,0:24:37.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.91,0:24:39.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's wonderful. Please cherish that spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.51,0:24:42.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, doesn't it make your bond even deeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.31,0:24:45.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Totally. You're basically best friends for life at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:47.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Cherish them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.94,0:24:47.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:50.81,Kent Ito,host_meta,0,0,0,,Next, we have a letter from Radio name: I want to drink coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.81,0:24:51.91,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Jiena-san, Kent-san, kon-vivid!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.91,0:24:52.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-vivid!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.81,0:24:53.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Kon-vivid!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.61,0:24:55.71,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I always enjoy listening to the show."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:59.21,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I don't really fight with my friends often, but..."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.96,0:25:00.00,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.21,0:25:05.33,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"...whenever we do, we have an unwritten rule to give each other a Tirol Choco when we say sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:06.40,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Aww, that's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.33,0:25:06.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, how sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.41,0:25:11.11,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It's nice to receive one, and it's fun to think about which flavor to give them."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.11,0:25:14.31,Kent Ito,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Does VBS have any unwritten rules like that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.31,0:25:15.57,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,What a lovely story.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.41,0:25:19.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's great. It probably makes it easier
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.41,0:25:21.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,to find an opening to make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.13,0:25:22.54,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.41,0:25:27.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's nice. Even\Nwhen it's a little hard to be the first one to say "I'm sorry,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.21,0:25:28.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,you can just hand them a chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:29.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Comment: 0,0:25:29.31,0:25:30.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.31,0:25:30.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It's nice to have a rule like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.96,0:25:31.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.71,0:25:32.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Does VBS have anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.91,0:25:34.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,A VBS rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.61,0:25:36.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Let's see... maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.51,0:25:39.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We all just do our own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.61,0:25:40.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That really is the ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.71,0:25:42.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We don't interfere with each other too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.81,0:25:44.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's definitely the ideal way to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.71,0:25:46.53,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.79,0:25:46.53,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.53,0:25:47.55,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.11,0:25:52.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I feel like we've just naturally fallen into that rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:58.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, is it like how Akina-san and Imai-kun start filming TikToks whenever we're all together for an event?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.91,0:25:59.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.46,0:26:00.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,And we just watch them warmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.31,0:26:04.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's basically an unwritten rule now.\NNobody says anything, they just start doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.86,0:26:06.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.21,0:26:07.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The two of us don't say a word about it, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.81,0:26:12.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're usually already practicing,\Nand we're just like, "What is it this time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.11,0:26:16.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right, and even if we suddenly end up in the shot,\Nwe're just like, "Oh well."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.11,0:26:18.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're just like, "Wait, what are we doing today?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.61,0:26:19.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's probably true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.81,0:26:22.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It might already be an unspoken agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.81,0:26:22.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.31,0:26:25.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not really a formal rule, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.71,0:26:27.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad it's become a regular thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.91,0:26:30.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. They were filming again, weren't they?\NDid they film at the Thanks Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.81,0:26:34.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,They did! They filmed at the Thanks Festival\Nthat you couldn't make it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.01,0:26:37.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Man, seriously...
Comment: 0,0:26:37.01,0:26:40.11,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.01,0:26:40.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I can't really say anything to that except "I'm so sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.11,0:26:42.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was hoping they'd do it, and they didn't disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.61,0:26:46.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, but there's also that. Even when some of us aren't there,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.41,0:26:49.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,we still end up in the group photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.72,0:26:50.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.31,0:26:50.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.31,0:26:52.14,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We do, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.21,0:26:52.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That might be a common thing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.81,0:26:54.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right, it probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.51,0:26:55.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. You sent one in for us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.21,0:26:56.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.41,0:26:59.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I was actually at a different event that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.11,0:27:02.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but I made sure to change clothes after it ended...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.60,0:27:02.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.01,0:27:03.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,...and took a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:03.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.81,0:27:06.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, so for those of you who saw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.81,0:27:10.06,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,that photo was actually brand new. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.61,0:27:12.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I took it right after my event and sent it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.51,0:27:15.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and then I was edited into the group photo from the other event.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.41,0:27:20.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing how you sent a photo that blended in so perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.11,0:27:21.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, I took a ton of shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.81,0:27:25.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I figured if I sent enough,\None of them would have to look natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.61,0:27:25.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.61,0:27:29.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,After that, I just said, "I'll leave the rest to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.29,0:27:29.67,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Trusting their editing skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.01,0:27:30.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I had full faith in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.71,0:27:32.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that definitely feels like a VBS rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.71,0:27:35.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Even if someone isn't there, we're still together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:35.50,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.
Comment: 0,0:27:35.50,0:27:36.51,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.50,0:27:36.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.51,0:27:40.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And well, when it comes to that sort of thing, our leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.01,0:27:41.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's definitely Akina-san, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.21,0:27:42.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.61,0:27:44.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,She's like the camera boss on SNS and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.71,0:27:48.88,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True. If we're taking photos,\Nit has to be with Akina-san's camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.38,0:27:50.66,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Akina-san.\NWe just leave it to her and say, "Please!"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.88,0:27:50.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.31,0:27:52.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow, we actually came up with quite a few\Nwhen we thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.81,0:27:53.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,There are surprisingly many.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.91,0:27:55.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's how VBS is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.39,0:27:56.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.21,0:27:58.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Okay, let's move on to the next mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.76,0:27:58.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.11,0:28:02.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Radio name: Shio no Kyuri-zuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.01,0:28:02.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Sounds delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.61,0:28:04.24,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay, oh, Kon-vivid!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.24,0:28:05.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Kon-vivid!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.01,0:28:07.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This is my first time sending in listener mail."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.26,0:28:08.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.71,0:28:11.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"When I get into a fight with a very close friend,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.21,0:28:13.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"we have set rules for fighting."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.06,0:28:13.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.41,0:28:18.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"First, we both say whatever we want to each other.\NOnce we've said our piece, I'll say,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.51,0:28:20.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"'I want this specific thing,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.31,0:28:23.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"and if you apologize along with giving it to me,\NI'll forgive you. How about you?'"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.91,0:28:26.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Then they'll say, 'Well, I've been interested in this thing,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.11,0:28:30.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"so if you give me that as an apology gift and say sorry,\Nwe're good.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.71,0:28:33.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"We tell each other what we want from a position of superiority,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.21,0:28:36.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"then exchange the items and apologize\Nat the same time on a later date to make up."
Comment: 0,0:28:36.91,0:28:38.46,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.91,0:28:38.46,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's actually great!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:42.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.31,0:28:43.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.41,0:28:43.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.61,0:28:48.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I think it's lovely, but everyone involved is being very mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.39,0:28:48.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.51,0:28:51.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's so peaceful. What a wonderful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.31,0:28:54.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,After all, even if you have a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.41,0:28:56.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,wanting to make up...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.31,0:28:59.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,is something\Nyou only do for someone who's truly important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.91,0:29:00.99,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.99,0:29:03.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wow, that's just... that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.41,0:29:04.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.31,0:29:07.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll try that if I ever get into a fight with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.81,0:29:11.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Though once you become an adult,\Nyou don't really get into fights anymore, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.06,0:29:11.56,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.21,0:29:14.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It never really reaches the level of a "fight," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.91,0:29:13.96,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.11,0:29:19.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You just feel like it's not a good idea to keep arguing past a certain point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.91,0:29:19.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.11,0:29:23.41,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you just end up saying,\N"Right, I see," and leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.51,0:29:23.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.41,0:29:26.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Man, I wonder what they bought recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.01,0:29:28.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I know, right? That sounds so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.91,0:29:32.06,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Do you have any memories of fighting with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.90,0:29:34.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.61,0:29:37.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I might not have any...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.21,0:29:38.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,at least not in the last few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.41,0:29:40.18,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I asked, but I don't have any either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.18,0:29:43.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't even know if you could call them "fights" anymore.
Comment: 0,0:29:42.61,0:29:43.61,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.61,0:29:43.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.61,0:29:45.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I've had moments where things got tense, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.01,0:29:46.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.51,0:29:50.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Being an adult is the worst, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.61,0:29:56.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It feels wrong to just call it a fight\Nwhen it's coming from my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.36,0:29:57.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.71,0:30:00.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Even though it's just a disagreement between adults...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.11,0:30:00.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:03.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It doesn't quite feel like a "fight."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:03.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.61,0:30:09.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's how it is. If I look back at actual fights...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.21,0:30:14.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Let's see. Well, it's usually just about the wording in an email.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.49,0:30:14.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.01,0:30:19.07,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, just being annoyed by how something was phrased.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.42,0:30:19.07,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.07,0:30:20.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.07,0:30:22.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Thinking, "Was there really no better way to say that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.51,0:30:22.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.31,0:30:27.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty common to feel that way,\Nor to have others feel that way about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.86,0:30:28.84,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.91,0:30:32.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But with SNS, or social media, or LINE...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.95,0:30:32.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.51,0:30:36.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I still have no idea what the "correct" way to write a message is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.01,0:30:39.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Text is so hard. It's really tough to get the tone across.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.33,0:30:38.62,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.21,0:30:41.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Work emails are difficult too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.94,0:30:41.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.71,0:30:44.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,You're not really supposed to use emojis or anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.31,0:30:45.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.61,0:30:46.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,In a professional email.
Comment: 0,0:30:45.31,0:30:46.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.31,0:30:46.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.21,0:30:51.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I don't know if "Understood" is right,\Nor if "Got it" is okay... I just don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.01,0:30:56.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Like, should I say "Yoroshiku onegaishimasu" or "Yoroshiku onegai itashimasu"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.51,0:30:57.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I just lose track of which to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.81,0:31:01.01,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, and the more polite you try to be,\Nthe colder it can end up looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.01,0:31:03.60,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. You end up wondering what the right move is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.60,0:31:05.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.61,0:31:05.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It happens all the time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.81,0:31:06.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.81,0:31:12.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. I feel like these little things will probably keep bothering me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.87,0:31:12.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.21,0:31:17.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,But it was lovely hearing\Nabout everyone's ways of making up after a fight today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.56,0:31:16.61,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.81,0:31:20.06,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I hope you all keep those traditions close.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.01,0:31:22.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I think that's everything. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:27.46,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Oh, right. That's all for this segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.96,0:31:24.92,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.01,0:31:30.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.31,0:31:30.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.11,0:31:32.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We got to share a lot of messages. We heard some great stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.61,0:31:39.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We really did. It made me think that if I ever get into a fight,\NI should try making a little rule for making up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.81,0:31:37.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.41,0:31:43.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Same here. Maybe I'll try it out with one of the VBS members.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.71,0:31:44.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.51,0:31:52.26,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes! This segment's theme was "How we made up." Thank you all for your submissions!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.28,0:31:46.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.81,0:32:05.76,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.85,0:32:07.52,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,SekaRaji!
Comment: 0,0:32:20.51,0:32:23.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.51,0:32:23.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,We've reached the end of this episode of SekaRaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.51,0:32:26.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're always looking for submissions from all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.21,0:32:31.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The address is sekairadio@pjsekai.jp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.71,0:32:34.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Please check the official ProSeka X account for more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.91,0:32:38.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's better to send your mail in early, so please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.71,0:32:40.52,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,And don't forget your Radio name!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.52,0:32:45.89,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,All right. Now, let's leave a comment\Nin the exchange notebook for the next pair of hosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.89,0:32:46.39,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.89,0:32:48.04,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Our comment will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.04,0:32:49.65,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,What should we go with?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.25,0:32:51.71,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.23,0:32:52.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.71,0:32:53.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,How about that one we talked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.11,0:32:56.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, the one we were just saying would be good?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.01,0:32:56.65,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.01,0:32:56.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Oh, is that okay? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:57.58,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.91,0:32:59.15,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.15,0:33:01.37,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.48,0:33:01.16,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Ito-san, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.37,0:33:02.01,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.01,0:33:03.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, since it's December...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.28,0:33:04.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.71,0:33:05.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,The kanji for December literally means "the master runs," so...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.56,0:33:06.06,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.61,0:33:07.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"When was the last time you ran?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.71,0:33:09.58,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,"And why?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.93,0:33:10.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Comment: 0,0:33:09.58,0:33:11.21,Kent Ito,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.58,0:33:11.21,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.31,0:33:11.21,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I want to hear the answer to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.21,0:33:16.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Well, you know, as you become an adult,\Nyou don't really get many chances to run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.71,0:33:16.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.31,0:33:18.61,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,So, it could be about running for exercise,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.61,0:33:19.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.61,0:33:21.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,or even just running because you're running late for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.91,0:33:21.41,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.31,0:33:24.71,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear some stories from you two about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.11,0:33:25.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.71,0:33:25.51,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for your mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.51,0:33:27.74,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.74,0:33:28.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.91,0:33:32.11,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,And just like that, we're already nearing the end of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.11,0:33:36.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,It's over already. Today was really nice, though.\NMy heart feels so warm now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.11,0:33:37.51,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I know, it was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.51,0:33:41.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,We're actually recording this in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.06,0:33:41.56,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.11,0:33:44.31,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,but I feel like I'll be able to spend the rest of the day feeling warm and fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.31,0:33:45.81,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I think so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.01,0:33:45.81,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.81,0:33:47.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.91,0:33:50.91,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,And with that, it's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.21,0:33:50.91,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.91,0:33:53.31,Tomomi Jiena Sumi,host,0,0,0,,I've been Tomomi Jiena Sumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.31,0:33:54.86,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,and I've been Kent Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.61,0:34:08.11,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,This program was brought to you by Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.11,0:34:10.16,Kent Ito,host,0,0,0,,feat. Hatsune Miku.
